  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Grant Funding for NCA-DCA for the project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to enhance climate and environmental justice for vulnerable communities in Malawi by strengthening local advocacy and accountability mechanisms. The project seeks to address two critical challenges: 1) the limited capacity of local actors to engage in climate justice advocacy, and 2) the lack of accountability among duty bearers and polluting companies in fulfilling environmental commitments. By the end of this intervention, 1) 60 Faith based actors (30 male, 20 male and 10 youth) and community structures are empowered on environmental and climate justice advocacy; 2) 40 Duty bearers (20 male, 15 female and 5 youth) are accountable and responsive to faith led advocacy initiatives on environmental and climate justice</narrative>
  </description>
